             so the layout is correct regardless of grid auto-placement/order quirks under RTL. -->
        <div class="lg:max-w-7xl lg:mx-auto lg:px-8 lg:pt-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-x-10 lg:gap-y-7 lg:items-start">

